This Act shall take effect upon its approval.
Approved, June 7, 1940, with exception of the following items : Section 1, Subsection A, paragraph (a) ;
Albay, Item 7; Bukidnon, Items 1, 3 and 4; Bulacan, Items 16 and 17; Camarines Sur, Items 11, 17 and 21;
Iloilo, Item 35; Pangasinan, Item 27; Samar, Items 7, 8, 10, 13, 14, 15, 18, 19, 21, 22, and 23.
